OL,3,GNEWSASidecar competitors welcome return
OL,4,Ato Southern 100
OL,5,
OL,6,FSidecar competitors have welcomed news
OL,7,Fthat the class will continue at the
OL,8,FSouthern 100 Races next year.
OL,10,FThere was uncertainty of its future
OL,11,Ffollowing the withdrawal of the
OL,12,Fmachines during the Isle of Man TT
OL,13,FRaces in June.
OL,15,FThis week organisers confirmed the
OL,16,Freturn with "updated" and "improved"
OL,17,Ftechnical regulations which will ensure
OL,18,Fcompetitor safety and financial
OL,19,Faccessibility.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,447,445,260,140,0,100
