OL,1,W5j 5Q5wsj  ws jkjs j#7kjs57k
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%,.*,$-, *.*  * %** %%* (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASidecar competitors welcome return
OL,4,Ato Southern 100
OL,5,
OL,6,F"By building upon our 2025 F2 600cc
OL,7,Fregulations and specifically banning
OL,8,Faerodynamic undertrays, we are
OL,9,Faddressing the stability issues
OL,10,Fidentified last year whilst ensuring
OL,11,Fthat the event is still accessible to
OL,12,Fthe teams who want to come and race,"
OL,13,Fsaid Giles Olley.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
